From 1a2025227cc9237c68e33221794b3762ad878854 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 13:01:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): sidebar shows every gateway's projects,
 colored per gateway, with show/hide toggles [daveey]

Projects overview folds in projects.tree from every connected registry
gateway (background fetch, 30s throttle, failure backoff); same-named
projects share a lane, remote-only ones get a namespaced lane. Session rows
get a left stripe in their gateway's color (local neutral, remotes take
palette slots; overridable). Filter menu > Gateways toggles visibility and
picks colors; both persist in localStorage.
